 - [OR] chronic opioid use (daily use within the 2 weeks prior to surgery [AND] duration of use > 4 weeks)
 - [OR] history of opioid abuse
 - [OR] any comorbidity which results in moderate [OR] severe functional limitation [OR] inability to communicate with the investigators [OR] hospital staff
 - [OR] pregnancy
 - [OR] planned regional analgesic with perineural catheter placement
 - [OR] incarceration
